### 登录获取 token
POST http://localhost:8080/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 带 token 添加学生
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjEsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoiYWRtaW4iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODI0NTkyMjMsImV4cCI6MTc4MjU0NTYyM30.5BYcEuBwfc5lp7yuuJno8XX1ICypwYkobPxmmZiWTd4

{
  "id": "300",
  "name": "创建人测试2",
  "age": 78,
  "score": 78
}

### 查询学生
GET http://localhost:8080/students/200
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjEsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoiYWRtaW4iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODI0NTkyMjMsImV4cCI6MTc4MjU0NTYyM30.5BYcEuBwfc5lp7yuuJno8XX1ICypwYkobPxmmZiWTd4

